/P 67 0 R
/E (Common programming languages used in traditional coding include Java, Python, C, C++, C#, JavaScript, and PHP. The choice of language depends on the application domain, such as web development, systems programming, enterprise software, or mobile application development. )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
