/E (A comparative study between the Traditional Coding Method and the Zoho Creator Low-Code Platform was successfully carried out. The study analyzed both methodologies across twenty- five technical and managerial parameters, and the results clearly indicate that Traditional Coding offers superior flexibility and control for complex, performance-critical applications, whereas Zoho Creator provides significantly faster, cost-effective, and simplified development suited for business process automation. )
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [13]
>>
endobj
334 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 74 0 R
/E (From this comparative study, it can be concluded that Traditional Coding and Zoho Creator's Low-Code Platform serve distinct but complementary roles within the software development landscape. Traditional coding remains indispensable for developing complex, high- performance, and highly customized systems, while Zoho Creator offers a rapid, cost-effective, and accessible alternative for building business applications with reduced technical overhead. The choice between the two approaches should therefore be guided by project complexity, )
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [14]
>>
endobj
